'''Shadow Gao''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] introduced in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]]. He can be unlocked by rolling the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] during the [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] or [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)|SUPERFEST]] event. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was introduced in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] but was officially obtainable in the [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.7 Update|September 15, 2023 Update Patch]].

