==Trivia==
*Shadow Gao is the first unit to only target [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]].
**When he was released, enemies that were Traitless and [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] such as [[Teacher Bun Bun]], were changed into purely Floating to prevent Shadow Gao from being too powerful.
*From July 14, 2023 to August 3, 2023, Shadow Gao, along with [[D'arktanyan (Uber Rare Cat)|D'arktanyan]], were accidentally made available in the gacha system in The Battle Cats Unite, despite not being properly added in Version 1.0.6. This was later fixed in Version 1.0.7 where these units were made unavailable until a future update.
**He was properly re-added in the September 14, 2023 Live Download Patch.

